# Title: Security Software Discovery - Linux
# ID: c9d8b7fd-78e4-44fe-88f6-599135d46d60
# Status: test
# Level: low
# Author: Daniil Yugoslavskiy, oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-19
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1518.001
# Description: Detects usage of system utilities (only grep and egrep for now) to discover security software discovery
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* sourcetype="syslog" ((process_path="*/grep" OR process_path="*/egrep") AND (process_exec="*nessusd*" OR process_exec="*td-agent*" OR process_exec="*packetbeat*" OR process_exec="*filebeat*" OR process_exec="*auditbeat*" OR process_exec="*osqueryd*" OR process_exec="*cbagentd*" OR process_exec="*falcond*"))
